<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH-Generale Bank rates Vedior a Buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH-Generale Bank rates Vedior a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>July research note summary</p>
<p>    Company-----Sector----------------Price-----Broker---------</p>
<p>    Vedior	temp labour,cleaning  51.50     Generale Bank</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy</p>
<p>Vedior's acquisition of French BIS made at a perfect time and at relatively low price. After a decline in 1996, the French temp market grew in first quarter and further growth seen in 1997 and 1998. Due to company's high exposure to French and Dutch markets we estimate double digit profit growth of 42 and 26 percent in 1997 and 1998 respectively. Our 12 month price target is at least 60.00 guilders.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):     EPS     P/E    P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1996/97 (actual)     1.27    40.6   29.8   n.a.</p>
<p>    1997/98		  1.80    28.6   21.5   0.50</p>
<p>    1998/99		  2.20    23.4   18.1   0.65</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
